      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "> **Reference**  \n> Chapter 11  \n> Classical Dynamics of Particles and Systems  \n> Stephen Thornton and Jerry B. Marion",
      "sourceSha256": "48c278b96c17caeaf5557f3e74ce4cf1c3cf1dd5a4b21272ecf78c78c90ab6db",
