    {
      "sourceRef": "index:5",
      "cellIndex": 5,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Inertia tensor from $O$\nThe problem asks for the inertia tensor. This includes every moment and product of inertia contained in the tensor.",
      "sourceSha256": "12813186ba9ab7b501204b2b3f4e97c7701dc02661c1ecd8177f53519cc1d989",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "O"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:6",
      "cellIndex": 6,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "import sympy as sm # import functions for symbolic manipulations\nfrom sympy.physics import mechanics as me \nme.init_vprinting() # dot notation for velocity and acceleration\nimport warnings\nwarnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")",
      "sourceSha256": "793ef5a00b8ba5cca5de7e88a2b6bea9bf18535d007f098aa8c765b7a89b4f26",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [
          "sympy",
          "sympy.physics",
          "warnings"
        ],
        "calls": [
          "me.init_vprinting",
          "warnings.filterwarnings"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:7",
      "cellIndex": 7,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "Ixx, Ixy, Ixz = sm.symbols('I_{xx} I_{xy} I_{xz}')\nIyx, Iyy, Iyz = sm.symbols('I_{yx} I_{yy} I_{yz}')\nIzx, Izy, Izz = sm.symbols('I_{zx} I_{zy} I_{zz}')",
      "sourceSha256": "5ac2e91ec51c7d55e535e88685579daadc44ed579245ff3c0133fa6a3b222a58",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.symbols"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:8",
      "cellIndex": 8,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "I = sm.Eq(\n  sm.Symbol('\\overline{\\overline{I} }'),\n  sm.Matrix([[Ixx, Ixy, Ixz], [Iyx, Iyy, Iyz], [Izx, Izy, Izz]]), \n  evaluate = False\n  )\nI",
      "sourceSha256": "54790a1bc7715e318969042b801e83ff27e95c209f0341e993105fabda232776",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "                           ⎡I_{xx}  I_{xy}  I_{xz}⎤\n                           ⎢                      ⎥\n\\overline{\\overline{I} } = ⎢I_{yx}  I_{yy}  I_{yz}⎥\n                           ⎢                      ⎥\n                           ⎣I_{zx}  I_{zy}  I_{zz}⎦",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\overline{\\overline{I} } = \\left[\\begin{matrix}I_{xx} & I_{xy} & I_{xz}\\\\I_{yx} & I_{yy} & I_{yz}\\\\I_{zx} & I_{zy} & I_{zz}\\end{matrix}\\right]$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.Matrix",
          "sm.Symbol"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:9",
      "cellIndex": 9,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Lets recall the expression for each element in the inertia tensor of a continuous system:\n$$\nI_{ik} = \\iiint \\rho(\\vec{r}) \\left(x_l^2 \\delta_{ik} -  x_i x_k \\right) dV .\n$$\nWe'll perform the calculations using cartesian coordinates, thus $dV = dx dy dz$. \nDensity is $\\rho = \\frac{m}{b^3}$.\n\nLet's start with one of the moments of inertia.\nThe first one corresponds to $i=x$ and $k=x$:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_{xx} \n&= \\iiint \\rho(\\vec{r}) \\left(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 - xx \\right) dV\\\\\n&= \\frac{m}{b^3} \\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} dx \\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} dy \\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} dz ( y^2 + z^2 ).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "a5eebcec6c855221e2d562c1d3a7d56ecf74ccd17a661e2e31580d381cd3bf4d",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nI_{ik} = \\iiint \\rho(\\vec{r}) \\left(x_l^2 \\delta_{ik} -  x_i x_k \\right) dV .\n"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "dV = dx dy dz"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\rho = \\frac{m}{b^3}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "i=x"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "k=x"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_{xx} \n&= \\iiint \\rho(\\vec{r}) \\left(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 - xx \\right) dV\\\\\n&= \\frac{m}{b^3} \\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} dx \\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} dy \\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} dz ( y^2 + z^2 ).\n\\end{aligned}\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:10",
      "cellIndex": 10,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "x, y, z, b, m = sm.symbols('x y z b m')\nf_xx = y**2 + z**2\nrho_density = m/ b**3\nIxx_exp = rho_density* sm.integrate(f_xx, (x, -b/2, b/2), (y, -b/2, b/2), (z,-b/2, b/2) )\nsm.Eq( Ixx , Ixx_exp )",
      "sourceSha256": "776f97b322bbc673145c8448e2456c1c43e272f3c8c78dd8515bb1997ccd0607",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "          2  \n         b ⋅m\nI_{xx} = ────\n          6  ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle I_{xx} = \\frac{b^{2} m}{6}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.integrate",
          "sm.symbols"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:11",
      "cellIndex": 11,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "The moments of inertia $I_{yy}$ and $I_{zz}$ are equal to this expression.",
      "sourceSha256": "b1ea8bd660ab5a87b546a950ac283621c341c76dcf1283994fd7e3371070f8ac",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "I_{yy}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "I_{zz}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:12",
      "cellIndex": 12,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "Iyy_exp = Ixx_exp\nIzz_exp = Ixx_exp",
      "sourceSha256": "72d35b832976a68c5c142694b151545ebdb665328bc306a89ef8bc8519ea8acc",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:13",
      "cellIndex": 13,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Next, the products of inertia with $i=x$.\nThe first one is the one with $k=y$:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_{xy} \n&= \\iiint \\rho(\\vec{r}) \\left(- xy \\right) dV\\\\\n&= \\frac{m}{b^3} \\int_0^b dz \\int_0^b dy \\int_0^b dx ( -xy ).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "c5977a6e76569d54dbbb8e5dfc01ee27848a3f00d676bc8a7ae2b625018ffe9b",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "i=x"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "k=y"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_{xy} \n&= \\iiint \\rho(\\vec{r}) \\left(- xy \\right) dV\\\\\n&= \\frac{m}{b^3} \\int_0^b dz \\int_0^b dy \\int_0^b dx ( -xy ).\n\\end{aligned}\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:14",
      "cellIndex": 14,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "f_xy = -x* y\nIxy_exp = rho_density* sm.integrate(f_xy, (x, -b/2, b/2), (y, -b/2, b/2), (z, -b/2, b/2) )\nsm.Eq( Ixy , Ixy_exp )",
      "sourceSha256": "78d82ad87c58adb0854c6cd0941e6bd67cd36f458beeedda9dcadb7bb691f6aa",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "I_{xy} = 0",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle I_{xy} = 0$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.integrate"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:15",
      "cellIndex": 15,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "It's easy to prove that every other product of inertia are the same.",
      "sourceSha256": "3f7f7eee9c230f036569c2d6b7f82d9b7f2a83bde6bf764162db7ca9496febd8",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:16",
      "cellIndex": 16,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "Ixz_exp = Ixy_exp\nIyx_exp = Ixy_exp\nIyz_exp = Ixy_exp\nIzx_exp = Ixy_exp\nIzy_exp = Ixy_exp",
      "sourceSha256": "243ebb402bb9e3aae2d1de53b0783806033cfc7312016ca04d81f895fe84a43a",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:17",
      "cellIndex": 17,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Therefor, the inertia tensor calculated from the center of mass $O$ with the axes directed as shown in the figure is",
      "sourceSha256": "776f2420262adbe92cdb55e05bfc385bb55a7f7f882b1b8044a794639a42e130",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "O"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:18",
      "cellIndex": 18,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "subsI = {\n    Ixx: Ixx_exp,\n    Ixy: Ixy_exp,\n    Ixz: Ixz_exp,\n    Iyx: Iyx_exp,\n    Iyy: Iyy_exp,\n    Iyz: Iyz_exp,\n    Izx: Izx_exp,\n    Izy: Izy_exp,\n    Izz: Izz_exp\n}\nI_subs = sm.Eq(sm.Symbol('\\overline{\\overline{I} }_O'), I.rhs.subs(subsI), evaluate = False )\nI_subs",
      "sourceSha256": "b158a3d529b558e3beb56b254d9606bf751c43c6756d52830a52429d79fc87e7",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "                             ⎡ 2              ⎤\n                             ⎢b ⋅m            ⎥\n                             ⎢────   0     0  ⎥\n                             ⎢ 6              ⎥\n                             ⎢                ⎥\n                             ⎢       2        ⎥\n                             ⎢      b ⋅m      ⎥\n\\overline{\\overline{I} }_O = ⎢ 0    ────   0  ⎥\n                             ⎢       6        ⎥\n                             ⎢                ⎥\n                             ⎢             2  ⎥\n                             ⎢            b ⋅m⎥\n                             ⎢ 0     0    ────⎥\n                             ⎣             6  ⎦",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\overline{\\overline{I} }_O = \\left[\\begin{matrix}\\frac{b^{2} m}{6} & 0 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{b^{2} m}{6} & 0\\\\0 & 0 & \\frac{b^{2} m}{6}\\end{matrix}\\right]$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
