    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:19",
      "cellIndex": 19,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### $\\overline{\\overline{I} }$ transferred to vertex $Q$ applying the Steiner's parallel axis theorem",
      "sourceSha256": "78d2f7dd4980ca02d1477cdd9946484a4ce571452ca52ae208a6cd9feb0f4e29",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\overline{\\overline{I} }"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "Q"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:20",
      "cellIndex": 20,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "If the origin of axes $x'_i$ is not at the center of mass:\n$$\nI'_{ik} = I_{ik} + m (a^2 \\delta_{ik} - a_i a_k ) \n$$\nwhere $\\vec{a}$ is directed from the center of mass to this frame of reference. This expression is known as **Steiner's theorem**.\n\nIn this case, $\\vec{a} = \\vec{OQ} = -\\frac{b}{2} \\hat{x} + (-\\frac{b}{2}) \\hat{y} + (-\\frac{b}{2}) \\hat{z} = -\\frac{b}{2} \\left( \\hat{x} + \\hat{y} + \\hat{z} \\right)$, so in order to find $I'_{ik}$, we have to add $m (a^2 \\delta_{ik} - a_i a_k )$ to the $I_{ik}$ calculated previously.\n\nFor the elements on the diagonal for which $i=k$, we have to calculate\n$$\n\\vec{a}^2 = \\frac{b^2}{4} \\left( \\hat{x} + \\hat{y} + \\hat{z} \\right) \\cdot \\left( \\hat{x} + \\hat{y} + \\hat{z} \\right) = \\frac{3 b^2}{4},\n$$\nand each $- a_i a_k$ is\n$$\n- a_i a_k = - \\left(-\\frac{b}{2} \\right) \\left( -\\frac{b}{2} \\right) = - \\frac{b^2}{4}.\n$$\n\nThen, subtracting the Steiner tensor from the one obtained previously is\n$$\nm (a^2 \\delta_{ik} - a_i a_k )\n= m \\frac{b^2}{4}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n3 -1 & -1 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & 3 -1 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & -1 & 3 -1 \\\\\n\\end{pmatrix}\n= m \\frac{b^2}{4}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2 & -1 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & -1 & 2 \\\\\n\\end{pmatrix}\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "509b2b05ce0ea9c1ced8c3c1744ed25ca29ea61cf9f51275d7ec7ff4598925f5",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "x'_i"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nI'_{ik} = I_{ik} + m (a^2 \\delta_{ik} - a_i a_k ) \n"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\vec{a}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\vec{a} = \\vec{OQ} = -\\frac{b}{2} \\hat{x} + (-\\frac{b}{2}) \\hat{y} + (-\\frac{b}{2}) \\hat{z} = -\\frac{b}{2} \\left( \\hat{x} + \\hat{y} + \\hat{z} \\right)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "I'_{ik}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "m (a^2 \\delta_{ik} - a_i a_k )"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "I_{ik}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "i=k"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\vec{a}^2 = \\frac{b^2}{4} \\left( \\hat{x} + \\hat{y} + \\hat{z} \\right) \\cdot \\left( \\hat{x} + \\hat{y} + \\hat{z} \\right) = \\frac{3 b^2}{4},\n"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "- a_i a_k"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n- a_i a_k = - \\left(-\\frac{b}{2} \\right) \\left( -\\frac{b}{2} \\right) = - \\frac{b^2}{4}.\n"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nm (a^2 \\delta_{ik} - a_i a_k )\n= m \\frac{b^2}{4}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n3 -1 & -1 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & 3 -1 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & -1 & 3 -1 \\\\\n\\end{pmatrix}\n= m \\frac{b^2}{4}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2 & -1 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\\n-1 & -1 & 2 \\\\\n\\end{pmatrix}\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:21",
      "cellIndex": 21,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "steiner = (m* b**2/ 4)* sm.Matrix(\n  [\n    [2, -1, -1],\n    [-1, 2, -1],\n    [-1, -1, 2]\n  ]\n  )\nsteiner",
      "sourceSha256": "59785074497b932fa9d748cd97216a0322ebae98364a91cc595b04207d988636",
      "outputs": [
